  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nDuring your Main Phase: You can Special Summon
    this card to your Main Monster Zone in its same column, also you cannot Special
    Summon non-\"Vaylantz\" monsters for the rest of this turn, except from the Extra
    Deck. You can only use this effect of \"Saion the Vaylantz Archer\" once per
    turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nIf you control this Special Summoned card: You
    can target 1 Effect Monster on the field; toss a coin and if the result is heads,
    negate its effects, or if the result is tails, halve its ATK. If this card in
    the Monster Zone moves to another Monster Zone: You can target 1 card on the
    field; toss a coin and if the result is heads, destroy it, or if the result is
    tails, return it to the hand. You can only use each effect of \"Saion the Vaylantz
    Archer\" once per turn."
